# Worker config. Copy to .env and fill in the secret key (.env is gitignored).
SUPABASE_URL=https://xqckpjbkzlafxidrwfju.supabase.co
# Supabase → Project Settings → API Keys: "service_role" (legacy) or "secret" (sb_secret_…).
# It can write to the database: never commit it or put it in the web page.
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=
# Optional: salt for the hashed authors behind unique user counts. Defaults to the secret
# key. Keep it stable: a new one makes everyone count as a new user for a week.
# AUTHOR_SALT=
# Optional: seed accounts for the web of trust behind user counts (hex pubkeys, comma
# separated). Defaults to fiatjaf and jack, see worker/wot.js.
# WOT_SEEDS=
